ssibilities.\n\nWe need to pick rows such that union is all 5 elements and no element repeated.\n\nLet's consider combinations.\n\nWe can use algorithm: try to cover each element.\n\nLet's list rows with elements:\n\nA: 0,1\nB: 3\nC: 2,3\nD: 4\nE: 3,4\nF: 0\nG: 1\nH: 2\n\nWe need to cover 0,1,2,3,4.\n\nWe can think of selecting rows that partition the set.\n\nWe can try to find all exact covers.\n\nLet's consider possibilities for element 0: either row A or F.\n\nSimilarly element 1: either A or G.\n\nElement 2: either C or H.\n\nElement 3: either B, C, or E.\n\nElement 4: either D or E.\n\nBut rows overlap: e.g., A covers 0 and 1 together. So if we pick A, we cannot pick F or G separately because they'd duplicate 0 or 1. Similarly, C covers 2 and 3 together. So if we pick C, we cannot pick H or B separately.\n\nE covers 3 and 4 together.\n\nD covers 4 alone.\n\nB covers 3 alone"}}],"created":1790955479,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-tw0ASDRPRlu633kXgxipVf5bWFBka1WB","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":514.878,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12302939068100359,"prompt_per_second":8128.139093144395,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2366.913,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.085936114732725,"predicted_per_second":324.0507783767295}}